WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Crouching lights begin the Tatsu knockdown route.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.150
Light Tatsu knocks Ken down beside the corner.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.650
Standing jab misses while Ken is down.

4
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.050
Collarbone Breaker hits as Ken rises.

5
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.050
Standing light punch leads into heavy Shoryuken.

6
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:05.850
Ken falls from the overhead conversion.
